    <string name="support_faq">Frequently asked</string>
    <string name="faq_1_q">Can I book flights or stays in the app?</string>
    <string name="faq_1_a">No. We show prices and links only. Book on the provider\'s own site.</string>
    <string name="faq_2_q">How are restaurants chosen?</string>
    <string name="faq_2_a">We weigh the rating and the day\'s route equally. Rating alone surfaces places far from your plan; route alone surfaces whatever happens to be nearby.</string>
    <string name="faq_3_q">Why two places for each meal?</string>
    <string name="faq_3_a">One is the highest scoring place; the other is an alternative chosen by budget, price or route. Each card is labelled with the reason it was picked.</string>
    <string name="faq_4_q">What can\'t I do without signing in?</string>
    <string name="faq_4_a">You can build any plan. Only saving and favorites need an account.</string>
    <string name="faq_5_q">The flight price doesn\'t match the real one.</string>
    <string name="faq_5_a">It\'s the price at the time of the search, and fares change constantly. If a card is marked \"sample data\", it is a reference value, not a live quote.</string>

